#: ../../../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:38 f3823e45cf054a948e76f38b42dc3250
msgid "The `normal` page-style definition in `book/conf.py` is a partial adaptation of `sphinx/texinputs/sphinxlatexstylepage.sty` from Sphinx 9.1.0. It retains the upstream header/footer arrangement and adds `\\footnotesize` to the running section and chapter marks. It is embedded in a differently named host file and does not replace the Sphinx package. The complete unmodified Sphinx 9.1.0 source is available from the [Sphinx 9.1.0 tag](https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx/tree/v9.1.0)."
msgstr "`book/conf.py` 中的 `normal` 页面样式定义，部分改编自 Sphinx 9.1.0 的 `sphinx/texinputs/sphinxlatexstylepage.sty`。它保留上游的页眉、页脚布局，并在连续显示的节标题和章标题中加入 `\\footnotesize`。该片段嵌入名称不同的宿主文件，并不替代 Sphinx 软件包。完整且未经修改的 Sphinx 9.1.0 源码见 [Sphinx 9.1.0 标签](https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx/tree/v9.1.0)。"

#: ../../../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:46 3c2092aa9a8f46369962607095793a26
msgid "The `\\TheAlphaChapter` definition in `book/conf.py` is a modified excerpt from the Bjarne style in Ulf A. Lindgren's `fncychap` 1.34. The adaptation keeps the appendix branch and changes English compound chapter names from concatenated forms such as `TWENTYONE` to hyphenated forms such as `TWENTY-ONE`. It is embedded in `book/conf.py`, not distributed as a replacement named `fncychap.sty`. The complete unmodified package is available from the [CTAN `fncychap` 1.34 package](https://ctan.org/pkg/fncychap). Copyright 2007 Ulf Lindgren. The upstream README permits distribution and modification under LPPL 1.3 or, at the recipient's option, any later version. DEAPack distributes this modified excerpt under LPPL 1.3c; the unmodified LPPL 1.3c text is reproduced below."
msgstr "`book/conf.py` 中的 `\\TheAlphaChapter` 定义，是根据 Ulf A. Lindgren 的 `fncychap` 1.34 Bjarne 样式修改而来的片段。改编后保留附录分支，并把 `TWENTYONE` 之类连写的英文复合章节名改为 `TWENTY-ONE` 之类的连字符形式。该片段嵌入 `book/conf.py`，不会以 `fncychap.sty` 这一替代文件名发布。完整且未经修改的软件包见 [CTAN `fncychap` 1.34 软件包](https://ctan.org/pkg/fncychap)。版权所有 2007 Ulf Lindgren。上游 README 允许按 LPPL 1.3，或由接收者选择的任何更高版本，分发和修改该作品。DEAPack 对本修改片段采用 LPPL 1.3c；下文原样转载未经修改的 LPPL 1.3c 文本。"

